new NarrativeDefinition("analysis-queue","Mira",new string[]{"Plan analyses","Analysen planen","Plan analyses","Plan analyses","Plan analyses","Plan analyses","Plan analyses"},new string[]{"You can queue up to {QUEUE} analyses. Choose a type and duration. Data is paid only when a job actually starts; missing resources and your data reserve hold the next job.","Du kannst bis zu {QUEUE} Analysen vormerken. Wähle Typ und Länge. Datenkosten werden erst beim echten Start bezahlt; fehlende Ressourcen und deine Datenreserve halten den nächsten Auftrag an.","You can queue up to {QUEUE} analyses. Choose a type and duration. Data is paid only when a job actually starts; missing resources and your data reserve hold the next job.","You can queue up to {QUEUE} analyses. Choose a type and duration. Data is paid only when a job actually starts; missing resources and your data reserve hold the next job.","You can queue up to {QUEUE} analyses. Choose a type and duration. Data is paid only when a job actually starts; missing resources and your data reserve hold the next job.","You can queue up to {QUEUE} analyses. Choose a type and duration. Data is paid only when a job actually starts; missing resources and your data reserve hold the next job.","You can queue up to {QUEUE} analyses. Choose a type and duration. Data is paid only when a job actually starts; missing resources and your data reserve hold the next job."}),
new NarrativeDefinition("analysis-repeat","Mira",new string[]{"Collect components automatically","Komponenten automatisch sammeln","Collect components automatically","Collect components automatically","Collect components automatically","Collect components automatically","Collect components automatically"},new string[]{"Analysis repeat is unlocked. Choose a type and duration, enable repeat and optionally set component targets. It stops when targets are reached or the budget is insufficient.","Die Analysewiederholung ist freigeschaltet. Wähle Typ und Länge, aktiviere die Wiederholung und setze bei Bedarf Komponentenziele. Sie stoppt bei erfüllten Zielen oder fehlendem Budget.","Analysis repeat is unlocked. Choose a type and duration, enable repeat and optionally set component targets. It stops when targets are reached or the budget is insufficient.","Analysis repeat is unlocked. Choose a type and duration, enable repeat and optionally set component targets. It stops when targets are reached or the budget is insufficient.","Analysis repeat is unlocked. Choose a type and duration, enable repeat and optionally set component targets. It stops when targets are reached or the budget is insufficient.","Analysis repeat is unlocked. Choose a type and duration, enable repeat and optionally set component targets. It stops when targets are reached or the budget is insufficient.","Analysis repeat is unlocked. Choose a type and duration, enable repeat and optionally set component targets. It stops when targets are reached or the budget is insufficient."}),
new NarrativeDefinition("analysis-budget","Mira",new string[]{"Research overnight","Über Nacht forschen","Research overnight","Research overnight","Research overnight","Research overnight","Research overnight"},new string[]{"Paid jobs and unlocked analysis plans continue offline within your offline limit. Reserved data stays protected. Check targets, reserve and remaining time; the return report shows actual finds.","Offline laufen bezahlte Aufträge und freigeschaltete Analysepläne innerhalb deines Offline-Limits weiter. Reservierte Daten bleiben geschützt. Prüfe Ziele, Reserve und Restlaufzeit; der Rückkehrbericht zeigt die echten Funde.","Paid jobs and unlocked analysis plans continue offline within your offline limit. Reserved data stays protected. Check targets, reserve and remaining time; the return report shows actual finds.","Paid jobs and unlocked analysis plans continue offline within your offline limit. Reserved data stays protected. Check targets, reserve and remaining time; the return report shows actual finds.","Paid jobs and unlocked analysis plans continue offline within your offline limit. Reserved data stays protected. Check targets, reserve and remaining time; the return report shows actual finds.","Paid jobs and unlocked analysis plans continue offline within your offline limit. Reserved data stays protected. Check targets, reserve and remaining time; the return report shows actual finds.","Paid jobs and unlocked analysis plans continue offline within your offline limit. Reserved data stays protected. Check targets, reserve and remaining time; the return report shows actual finds."}),
new NarrativeDefinition("prologue-welcome","Mira",new string[]{"","","","","","",""},new string[]{"Good, you are here. I am Dr. Mira Voss. This is our garage laboratory.","Gut, du bist da. Ich bin Dr. Mira Voss. Das hier ist unser Garagenlabor.","Good, you are here. I am Dr. Mira Voss. This is our garage laboratory.","Good, you are here. I am Dr. Mira Voss. This is our garage laboratory.","Good, you are here. I am Dr. Mira Voss. This is our garage laboratory.","Good, you are here. I am Dr. Mira Voss. This is our garage laboratory.","Good, you are here. I am Dr. Mira Voss. This is our garage laboratory."}),
new NarrativeDefinition("prologue-aura","Mira",new string[]{"","","","","","",""},new string[]{"This is {AI}. For now, the entire model runs on modest hardware.","Das ist {AI}. Im Moment läuft das ganze Modell auf bescheidener Hardware.","This is {AI}. For now, the entire model runs on modest hardware.","This is {AI}. For now, the entire model runs on modest hardware.","This is {AI}. For now, the entire model runs on modest hardware.","This is {AI}. For now, the entire model runs on modest hardware.","This is {AI}. For now, the entire model runs on modest hardware."}),
new NarrativeDefinition("prologue-funding","Mira",new string[]{"","","","","","",""},new string[]{"The grant is gone. Credits fund hardware and model training; data enables research.","Die Förderung ist weg. Credits finanzieren Hardware und Modelltraining; Daten ermöglichen Forschung.","The grant is gone. Credits fund hardware and model training; data enables research.","The grant is gone. Credits fund hardware and model training; data enables research.","The grant is gone. Credits fund hardware and model training; data enables research.","The grant is gone. Credits fund hardware and model training; data enables research.","The grant is gone. Credits fund hardware and model training; data enables research."}),
