new NarrativeDefinition("first-prestige","Mira",new string[]{"","","","","","",""},new string[]{"The restart yielded {LAST_INT} INT. Credits, hardware, and model levels reset; data, research, collection, and crafting remain. Spend INT on persistent nodes.","Der Neustart brachte {LAST_INT} INT. Credits, Hardware und Modell wurden zurückgesetzt; Daten, Forschung, Sammlung und Crafting bleiben. INT kaufst du im Prestige-Baum für dauerhafte Knoten.","The restart yielded {LAST_INT} INT. Credits, hardware, and model levels reset; data, research, collection, and crafting remain. Spend INT on persistent nodes.","The restart yielded {LAST_INT} INT. Credits, hardware, and model levels reset; data, research, collection, and crafting remain. Spend INT on persistent nodes.","The restart yielded {LAST_INT} INT. Credits, hardware, and model levels reset; data, research, collection, and crafting remain. Spend INT on persistent nodes.","The restart yielded {LAST_INT} INT. Credits, hardware, and model levels reset; data, research, collection, and crafting remain. Spend INT on persistent nodes.","The restart yielded {LAST_INT} INT. Credits, hardware, and model levels reset; data, research, collection, and crafting remain. Spend INT on persistent nodes."}),
